{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James! Long time no see! A lot's changed since we talked. I started getting into board games. I tried one last week and it turned out to be a lot of fun. What's new with you?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-2fcc0acfcdb7d8e2b2b21998", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.124589+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2fcc0acfcdb7d8e2b2b21998", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2fcc0acfcdb7d8e2b2b21998", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! Cool, what kind of board game is this? I had a lot to do all this time. And in order not to forget to do something, I started writing down everything I needed in a notebook."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-c5bed6b15f3292c48951e64f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.149338+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c5bed6b15f3292c48951e64f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c5bed6b15f3292c48951e64f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: This game is called \"Dungeons of the Dragon\", very exciting! I'm really glad you're writing down what you need to do in a notebook. This will definitely help you not to forget anything! How did you come up with this idea? In general, where do you get ideas?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-06f0d8754f17fbe8c6ac0bf0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.163431+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "06f0d8754f17fbe8c6ac0bf0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "06f0d8754f17fbe8c6ac0bf0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks, John! I get them from various sources like books, movies, and even dreams."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-3516c0157900009ee23d7430", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.182631+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3516c0157900009ee23d7430", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3516c0157900009ee23d7430", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, dreams have inspired you? That's interesting. Have any specific dreams guided your ideas?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-7670a418972e1b31bede6c68", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.195354+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7670a418972e1b31bede6c68", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7670a418972e1b31bede6c68", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: A few weeks ago I had this crazy dream that led to some creative ideas. It was so vivid I woke up with some interesting thoughts!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-4b7e64e8574a59e66c7a4f1b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.211127+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4b7e64e8574a59e66c7a4f1b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4b7e64e8574a59e66c7a4f1b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, dreams can be so awesome! Are there any specific details you remember from that one?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-7397b85f86eef5184c58bfe1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.225343+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7397b85f86eef5184c58bfe1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7397b85f86eef5184c58bfe1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I remember there was a medieval castle with its own labyrinth full of puzzles and traps. It felt like playing a video game in real life!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-68432c5fff30090aba2a36ca", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.238869+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "68432c5fff30090aba2a36ca", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "68432c5fff30090aba2a36ca", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, exploring a castle with puzzles and traps sounds awesome! Have you got any sketches or notes from that experience? I'd love to take a look!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-4786e112e521953d10da2a2e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.253635+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4786e112e521953d10da2a2e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4786e112e521953d10da2a2e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yep! I made some sketches and notes. Hang on, let me grab them."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-9a2fe6efa108d6175c1d1fc0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.264654+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9a2fe6efa108d6175c1d1fc0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9a2fe6efa108d6175c1d1fc0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Nice sketch! Do you like music, or is it related to your castle dream?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-54aae73016112895b0adf86d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.276670+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "54aae73016112895b0adf86d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "54aae73016112895b0adf86d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Thanks! Music is a big part of my life - nothing to do with castles though. What kind of music do you like? Do you play any instruments?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-abdaa3d2f71b98da8a200c81", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.290436+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "abdaa3d2f71b98da8a200c81", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "abdaa3d2f71b98da8a200c81", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cool! I'm into electronic and rock music. I used to play drums when I was younger, but haven't in a while. Do you play any instruments?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-79697ecd8c971db4a667f198", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.306468+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "79697ecd8c971db4a667f198", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "79697ecd8c971db4a667f198", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yeah, rock's awesome! I used to play a guitar when I was younger but haven't in a while."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-04486cef6ec2c6c0d78301bd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.320405+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "04486cef6ec2c6c0d78301bd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "04486cef6ec2c6c0d78301bd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Playing drums when I was younger was a fun way to let off steam. Here's a photo of an old drum set I used to play on."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-0e15994233796827e49972c9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.334610+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0e15994233796827e49972c9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0e15994233796827e49972c9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Cool! Have you ever been in a band or just jammed with friends?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-e22a6608e3f2cc1446e3731a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.347052+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e22a6608e3f2cc1446e3731a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e22a6608e3f2cc1446e3731a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I've jammed with friends before, it was a lot of fun!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-c6d649ddc530a51f22deec57", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.359684+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c6d649ddc530a51f22deec57", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c6d649ddc530a51f22deec57", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Sounds awesome! Jamming with friends is always a blast. Do you have any recordings or videos of those sessions?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-a61ccc9b601355196327dc2a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.369702+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a61ccc9b601355196327dc2a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a61ccc9b601355196327dc2a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Nah, it was more about the experience and the moment. No recordings or videos from the jams."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-378180fa4c998da7bb10dcaa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.385285+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "378180fa4c998da7bb10dcaa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "378180fa4c998da7bb10dcaa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: No problem! It's nice to just enjoy the experience without worrying about collecting videos or recordings. By the way, I started streaming games. No details yet, I hope everything works out."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-3.3-V5-VERIFIED-FULL-2026-09-09-locomo-conv-47/session_24-65c5472e1e4414eb6d611925", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T05:51:18.397309+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "65c5472e1e4414eb6d611925", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "65c5472e1e4414eb6d611925", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
